cff-version: 1.2.0
title: nf-nomad deployment and validation templates
message: If you use these templates, please cite both this record and the nf-nomad manuscript.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/abhi18av/nf-nomad-templates"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible infrastructure templates and a reviewer protocol for nf-nomad, the Nextflow
  executor plugin for HashiCorp Nomad. Provides a single-laptop Multipass deployment and a
  heterogeneous cloud deployment spanning OCI persistent nodes and GCP preemptible instances,
  together with per-mode Nextflow configurations and a preemption-resilience harness.
keywords:
  - Nextflow
  - HashiCorp Nomad
  - bioinformatics
  - workflow management
  - reproducibility
  - infrastructure as code
authors:
  - given-names: Abhinav
    family-names: Sharma
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6402-6993"
